  CORE ARGUMENT: Plekhanov's late, more systematic exposition of dialectical and historical materialism, addressing the philosophical foundations of Marxism, its relation to Hegelian dialectics and eighteenth-century materialism, and the application of monism to problems of economic determinism and the role of geographic and other objective conditions in history.

