  POSITION: Contemporary reassessment by a specialist historian arguing for
  Plekhanov's continued, under-recognized theoretical significance despite his
  political marginalization after 1917.
  },
  keywords = {reassessment, neglect-thesis, reception, Medium, web-source, INCOMPLETE, no-abstract}
}

